	<section_number>38.2-3813</section_number>
	<catch_line>Suits against company</catch_line>
	<text>
		A suit or an action at law may be instituted against any company in any county or city in this Commonwealth.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 38-495; 1950, p. 242; 1952, c. 317, § 38.1-512; 1986, c. 562.</history>
